  "title": "gsm_osmux: Fix AMR_SID frame type payload size",
  "description": "According to TS 26.101, AMR_SID payload is 39 bits.\nHence, (39+7)/8 = 5, rounding to octet boundaries.\n\nThis fixes incorrect dissecting of Osmux frames containing AMR_SID\npayloads.",
